WEBVTT

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:21.920
was there, at the dawn of the third age of mankind. It began in the Earth year 2257,

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:29.760
the founding of the last of the Babylon stations, located deep in neutral space.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.150
was a port of call for

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.590
refugees, smugglers,

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.980
