00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.850
It would be a dangerous place

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.330
that we accepted the risk

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.930
because Babylon 5

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.360
was our last, best

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.910
hope for peace. Babylon

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:56.490
5 was a dream

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:00.000
given for, a dream of a

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.960
galaxy without war and species from different worlds could live side by side in mutual respect.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:19.860
Babylon 5 was the last of the Babylon stations. This is its story. Confirmed, Delta Gamma Niner.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.110
You are clear for docking. Please surrender control of your vessel to central computer on my mark.

