00:48:51.200 --> 00:48:56.160
Lieutenant Commander Takashima, you will take Commander Sinclair's place on the council.

00:48:56.160 --> 00:49:00.000
With all due respect, Senator, I object. This entire

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:05.520
situation is... Laurel, this is difficult for all of us, but I ask that you set aside your personal

00:49:05.520 --> 00:49:15.160
feelings. Consider the best interest of the station. All right, I'll do my best. Jeff, once the council

00:49:15.160 --> 00:49:20.680
gets into this, there's nothing we can do without compromising the neutrality of Babylon 5. We can't

00:49:20.680 --> 00:49:26.970
let that happen. I understand, Senator. Thank you for telling me yourself. Babylon 5 out.

00:49:30.160 --> 00:49:32.010
- That's it?

00:49:32.010 --> 00:49:33.730
You're just gonna cave in and let them do this to you?

00:49:33.730 --> 00:49:34.730
- I have my reasons.

00:49:34.730 --> 00:49:36.290
- You can't expect her to stand here

00:49:36.290 --> 00:49:38.170
and do nothing while they railroad you.

00:49:38.170 --> 00:49:40.910
