01:12:52.520 --> 01:12:54.510
Environment tech named Hazeltine.

01:12:54.510 --> 01:12:59.830
Ben says he's been dead at least 16 hours, but according to a couple of his co-workers, they say they saw him.

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:08.740
just recently. Sinclair. Commander, I'm in Dale Varner's quarters. You and Garibaldi better get

01:13:08.740 --> 01:13:15.870
down here. There's something you should see. On our way. We were finally able to crack Varner's

01:13:15.870 --> 01:13:19.980
access code. He was a tech runner all by transporting forbidden technology across

01:13:19.980 --> 01:13:26.290
systems. His last job took him to the entire sector for a changeling net. The ultimate in

01:13:26.290 --> 01:13:30.000
camouflage. It sets up a holographic field that can be adjusted to project a

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:30.580
False image.

01:13:30.940 --> 01:13:32.920
And that's what Karsh saw in the docking bay.

01:13:33.380 --> 01:13:35.930
Not the commander, but someone made to look like him.

01:13:37.020 --> 01:13:37.780
Pretty neat trick.

01:13:38.220 --> 01:13:39.980
An expensive and very dangerous trick.

01:13:40.510 --> 01:13:42.730
Changeling nets are outlawed in every civilized sector.

01:13:43.190 --> 01:13:46.610
Prolonged exposure to an energy field that intense and unstable can be fatal.

01:13:47.090 --> 01:13:48.850
And our little pal's been using it constantly.

01:13:49.400 --> 01:13:52.060
A system like this would have to put out a lot of energy.

01:13:52.470 --> 01:13:57.870
Laurel, can you recalibrate the station's external sensors to scan for energy sources inside the station?

01:13:58.150 --> 01:13:58.710
We can try.

01:13:58.870 --> 01:13:59.610
Good, do so.

01:13:59.730 --> 01:14:00.000
Kerbal?

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:03.240
and I will be along shortly we have to stop at security there's a few things I

01:14:03.240 --> 01:14:12.280
want to pick up security standing by what's the situation we're closing the

01:14:12.280 --> 01:14:18.220
final relays now and switching over to a new program got it all right filter out

01:14:18.220 --> 01:14:22.420
all known energy sources life support utilities defense grid any energy that

01:14:22.420 --> 01:14:27.440
we're putting out on it compensate for ambient heat energy from the solar

01:14:27.440 --> 01:14:29.190
collectors

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:40.830
it is got it where is it red 12 come on come on level 7a all right seal off the area i'm taking

01:14:40.830 --> 01:14:46.250
care of this personally if we need help we'll link in wait better take a recorder the way things are

01:14:46.250 --> 01:14:59.190
going you may need a witness thanks let's go good luck we're registering an energy search at the jump point

