The frequency matches the Vorline ship that came through earlier.

01:15:03.140 --> 01:15:05.090
Must be the transport ship, damn!

01:15:05.090 --> 01:15:07.100
That's not a transport.

01:15:08.610 --> 01:15:16.070
Sanders ride is here.

01:15:49.680 --> 01:15:50.870
