01:15:52.790 --> 01:15:53.750
It's moving again.

01:16:08.090 --> 01:16:09.540
There it is.

01:17:33.710 --> 01:17:34.710
It's true, okay?

01:17:34.710 --> 01:17:38.360
Even I am.

01:17:38.360 --> 01:17:42.520
I'll be alright.

01:17:42.520 --> 01:17:44.520
Lieutenant Commander, the Vorlon captain is demanding

01:17:44.520 --> 01:17:46.520
we turn over Commander Sinclair for transport to Homeworld.

01:17:46.520 --> 01:17:49.520
Stall, patch into the signal from the commander's recorder.

01:17:49.520 --> 01:17:51.520
If we could broadcast that signal to the Vorlon ship...

01:17:51.520 --> 01:17:52.690
I'm on it.

01:18:01.150 --> 01:18:03.270
saying unless we turn over the commander in five minutes,

01:18:03.270 --> 01:18:04.650
they'll open fire on the station.

01:18:04.650 --> 01:18:06.100
Tell him to get stuffed.

01:18:06.100 --> 01:18:08.760
Activate defensive grid, screens to maximum,

01:18:08.760 --> 01:18:11.590
