01:19:31.080 --> 01:19:39.430
- Orange?

01:19:39.430 --> 01:19:41.250
- Ball-on weapon systems powering up.

01:19:41.250 --> 01:19:43.050
They're locking onto us, preparing to fire.

01:19:43.050 --> 01:19:44.450
