01:19:44.450 --> 01:19:45.740
- Online, now.

01:19:45.740 --> 01:19:47.790
- Broadcast, all frequencies.

01:19:47.790 --> 01:19:49.780
Let them see what's going on.

01:20:00.510 --> 01:20:20.200
you. Did you do it? There is a hole in your mind. Oh my god. He's wired. Brace for explosion.

01:20:20.540 --> 01:20:28.390
Come press your doors. Seal off the section. Not with you inside. Alex, do it. I gave you an order.

01:20:28.390 --> 01:20:29.380
No.

01:21:00.380 --> 01:21:01.300
- Not responding.

01:21:01.300 --> 01:21:02.150
