01:29:18.660 --> 01:29:24.750
most unpleasant look on the bright side ambassador from now on whenever you raise a

01:29:24.750 --> 01:29:28.390
toast to the good health of babylon 5 i'll know you mean every word of it

01:29:35.280 --> 01:29:43.120
"There we were. Large. It nearly eclipsed the sun. Suddenly, we fell on them like a wave, falling upon a shore."

01:29:43.120 --> 01:29:43.700
"Later."

01:29:43.700 --> 01:29:55.960
"Beep beep. Beep beep? Must be Earth humor. Who can figure a species like that? Beep beep."

01:30:10.620 --> 01:30:11.600
I'd say you took that pretty well.

01:30:12.220 --> 01:30:14.380
Think they'll ever find that transmitter you slipped your car?

01:30:14.680 --> 01:30:16.670
No, because there isn't one.

01:30:17.440 --> 01:30:18.000
There isn't?

01:30:18.850 --> 01:30:19.190
Wait.

01:30:20.100 --> 01:30:20.660
I lied.

01:30:21.590 --> 01:30:24.770
I figured if there were a transmitter, sooner or later they'd find it and remove it.

01:30:25.360 --> 01:30:28.490
But if I just told them there was, they'd keep looking.

01:30:29.470 --> 01:30:29.800
Indefinitely.

01:30:30.800 --> 01:30:32.820
Commander, do you have any idea of the tests they'll put him through,

01:30:32.920 --> 01:30:35.500
the things they'll do to him trying to find a transmitter that's not there?

01:30:36.090 --> 01:30:36.470
Yes.

01:30:38.610 --> 01:30:39.010
Come on.

01:30:40.360 --> 01:30:43.250
There are some days I just love this job.

01:30:52.520 --> 01:30:55.700
Can I have your attention?

01:30:57.480 --> 01:31:00.000
You all please join me in welcoming to Babel.

01:31:00.000 --> 01:31:07.330
Babylon 5, our final representative, Ambassador Koch of the Vorlon Empire.

01:31:40.840 --> 01:31:41.760
You left the reception.

01:31:43.540 --> 01:31:46.590
I needed a little quiet, I think.

01:31:48.750 --> 01:31:53.770
Elen, just before he died, the Minbari assess and looked at me and said,

01:31:54.140 --> 01:31:55.830
there is a hole in your mind.

01:31:59.280 --> 01:32:00.000
An old...

01:32:00.060 --> 01:32:08.910
minbari insult nothing you need to worry about maybe it's just there's a 24-hour period in my

01:32:08.910 --> 01:32:15.830
life that i can't account for it happened during the war with your people you wouldn't be holding

01:32:15.830 --> 01:32:24.190
anything out on me would you old friend commander i would never tell you anything that was not in

01:32:24.190 --> 01:32:29.960
your best interest well we'll talk about

01:32:30.000 --> 01:32:31.340
this again one of these days.

01:32:34.010 --> 01:32:36.180
Come on, we should get back to the reception.

01:32:37.400 --> 01:32:39.520
By the way, there's

01:32:39.520 --> 01:32:40.980
something I've been wondering.

01:32:42.500 --> 01:32:44.480
Why, Babylon 5?

01:32:46.020 --> 01:32:47.570
If the prior forestations

01:32:47.570 --> 01:32:49.110
were lost or destroyed,

01:32:50.370 --> 01:32:51.390
why build another?

01:32:52.330 --> 01:32:54.300
Plain old human stubbornness, I guess.

01:32:55.440 --> 01:32:57.600
When something we value is destroyed, we rebuild it.

01:32:57.600 --> 01:33:00.000
If it's destroyed again, we rebuild it

01:33:00.000 --> 01:33:06.450
again, and again, and again, and again, until it stays.

01:33:08.840 --> 01:33:13.780
That, as our poet Tennyson once said, is the goal, to strive, to seek, to find, and not

01:33:13.780 --> 01:33:14.260
to yield.

01:33:15.100 --> 01:33:15.620
A poet?

01:33:16.280 --> 01:33:17.520
Someone who writes poems.

01:33:18.390 --> 01:33:20.210
A poem, a story, and meet her a rhyme.

01:33:21.550 --> 01:33:24.850
Ah, there once was a man from Nantucket.

01:33:25.740 --> 01:33:28.510
You've been talking to Garapaldi again, haven't you?

01:33:29.110 --> 01:33:29.510
Yes.

01:33:29.510 --> 01:33:29.730
Yes.

01:33:30.320 --> 01:33:31.040
How did you know?

01:33:31.310 --> 01:33:33.100
Oh, just a wild guess.

01:33:35.910 --> 01:33:37.450
Open all communications channels.

01:33:40.110 --> 01:33:42.190
This is Lieutenant Commander Laurel Takashima.

01:33:42.750 --> 01:33:44.970
Our docking base stand ready to receive you.

01:33:45.930 --> 01:33:48.210
Babylon 5 is open for business.
